{"id":"e8285984e352a6ff","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-coherent-fibration.md","title":"coherent 纤维化","display":"df-coherent-fibration — coherent 纤维化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-coherent-fibration","aliases":["16-df-coherent-fibration","Coherent fibration","16-coherent-fibration"],"display":"df-coherent-fibration — coherent 纤维化","depends_on":["[[16-df-regular-fibration]]","[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]"],"source":"Definition 4.2.1(ii), p. 233 (PDF 253)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-coherent-fibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-coherent-fibration</span><span>Coherent fibration</span><span>16-coherent-fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-coherent-fibration — coherent 纤维化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a15697ec1bc8115\" href=\"?note=6a15697ec1bc8115\" title=\"16-df-regular-fibration\">16-df-regular-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ae1a27a060629395\" href=\"?note=ae1a27a060629395\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts\">16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 4.2.1(ii), p. 233 (PDF 253)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为纤维化；正则性和纤维有限余积见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6a15697ec1bc8115\" href=\"?note=6a15697ec1bc8115\" title=\"16-df-regular-fibration\">16-df-regular-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ae1a27a060629395\" href=\"?note=ae1a27a060629395\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts\">16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{CohFib}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ae1a27a060629395\" href=\"?note=ae1a27a060629395\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts\">16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegFib}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6a15697ec1bc8115\" href=\"?note=6a15697ec1bc8115\" title=\"16-df-regular-fibration\">16-df-regular-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在下式的正则性及有限余积存在分支中选定纤维有限积与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}\\)</span> 的见证族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_I,\\vee_I\">\\(\\wedge_I,\\vee_I\\)</span> 使用上述直接依赖中正式给出的积、余积别名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\">\\(X,Y,Z\\)</span> 遍历相应纤维对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_I\">\\(\\simeq_I\\)</span> 为同一预序中的双向可达关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CohFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I)(\\forall X,Y,Z\\in\\mathcal E_I)\\\nX\\wedge_I(Y\\vee_IZ)\\simeq_I(X\\wedge_IY)\\vee_I(X\\wedge_IZ).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CohFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I)(\\forall X,Y,Z\\in\\mathcal E_I)\\\nX\\wedge_I(Y\\vee_IZ)\\simeq_I(X\\wedge_IY)\\vee_I(X\\wedge_IZ).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>各纤维是分配格的预序呈现；不要求每个纤维自身是本书 §4.5 的 coherent 范畴。</li>\n<li>底对象和并保持换基，已经包含在 <code>FibFinCoprod</code> 内。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 4.2.1(ii), p. 233 (PDF 253)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-regular-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6a15697ec1bc8115","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-regular-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts","status":"resolved","id":"ae1a27a060629395","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-regular-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6a15697ec1bc8115","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；正则性和纤维有限余积见 [[16-df-regular-fibration]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts","status":"resolved","id":"ae1a27a060629395","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；正则性和纤维有限余积见 [[16-df-regular-fibration]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts","status":"resolved","id":"ae1a27a060629395","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-regular-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6a15697ec1bc8115","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegFib}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-regular-fibration]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CohFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge_I,\\vee_I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y,Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CohFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(p)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I)(\\forall X,Y,Z\\in\\mathcal E_I)\\\nX\\wedge_I(Y\\vee_IZ)\\simeq_I(X\\wedge_IY)\\vee_I(X\\wedge_IZ).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1835,"backlinks":[{"id":"688c730fdec8e028","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p$ 为纤维化，$\\mathrm{CohFib}$ 见 [[16-df-coherent-fibration]]，$\\mathrm{CohFib}_{df}$ 为旧拼写。"},{"id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；相关结构分别见 [[16-df-coherent-fibration]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-simple-quantification]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-coherent-fibration|df-coherent-fibration — coherent 纤维化]]"}],"outgoing":["6a15697ec1bc8115","ae1a27a060629395"]}